### Core Utilities (src/util/utils.ts)

- `normalizeOptions()`: Normalizes project setup options and paths
- `isApplication()`: Validates project is application type
- `getProjectOutputDirectory()`: Resolves project output paths
- `rebuildNativeModules()`: Rebuilds native modules for Electron
- `resolveIconCommand()`: Generates png2icons commands
